WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:21.541
Kirish: Har bir bazaning o‘ziga xosligi

00:21.541 --> 00:50.529
MySQL: Boolean yo‘q, TINYINT(1) tuzog‘i

00:50.529 --> 01:22.414
MySQL: UUID va indekslangan ENUM

01:22.414 --> 01:44.441
SQLite: Hech qanday maxsus tip yo‘q

01:44.441 --> 02:11.837
Amaliyotdagi eng xavfli 6 ta tuzoq

02:11.837 --> 02:31.120
Taqqoslash jadvali va yakun
